# No hyphens in user-facing copy

Do not use hyphens (`-`), en dashes (`–`), or em dashes (`—`) in user-visible text on norwayshoreexcursions.com.

## Use instead

- `all aboard` not `all-aboard`
- `return to ship` not `return-to-ship` (URLs like `/return-to-ship-guide` may keep hyphens)
- `tool, not` or `tool. Not` not `tool — not`
- `4 to 6 hours` not `4–6 hours`
- `AI style` not `AI-style`
- `rules based` not `rules-based`

## Allowed hyphens

- URL paths and slugs (`/norway-cruise-planner`, `flam`)
- CSS class names and code identifiers (theme keys like `family-friendly` in data)
- File and folder names

Rephrase with commas, periods, or spaces rather than dashes.
